Throwing food is like throwing any other item:
1. hit "t" for throw.
2. type the letter for the item you want to throw.
3. type the correct direction.
It is as simple as that...

A food item doesn't appear on the list of "throwable" items, because
it is not something you usually throw around.  But you can still
throw it.  You may find the inventory letter of a food item by using the 
inventory commands, or by typing an asterisk instead of an inventory letter.
